# Whack-a-mole: every mole whacked over a round of 45 s: a score, no stray whacks; then over
wait 800
turn SELECT 6
wait 400
expect cab 6
tap PLAY
wait 100
shot stand.png
autowhack on
tap PLAY
wait 10000
shot playing.png
expect whack_score >10
wait 37000
expect whack_state 2
expect whack_stray 0
shot over.png
